{"seq":3,"slug":"creative-cost-scale-metric","title":"创意生产成本与规模化指标","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/marketing-creative-dam-aigc-production/creative-performance-loop/creative-cost-scale-metric","wordCount":3288,"readingTime":14,"html":"<h1 id=\"创意生产成本与规模化指标\">创意生产成本与规模化指标</h1><p>AIGC 让创意生产的边际成本看起来趋近于零，这个印象是错的。模型调用只是成本的一小部分，人工审校、本地化复核、渠道适配与返工才是主体。搞不清成本结构会导致两种错误决策：以为生成便宜而无限扩张变体数量，以及以为审校便宜而不断加大抽样密度。这一节给出创意生产的成本计量方法与衡量规模化程度的指标集，让这两类决策有数可依。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-成本的四个归集维度\">核心概念：成本的四个归集维度</h2><p>创意生产的成本必须能按四个维度切开，否则任何优化都无从下手：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  C[&quot;创意总成本&quot;] --&gt; D1[&quot;按阶段&lt;br/&gt;生成/审校/适配/返工&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; D2[&quot;按产出单位&lt;br/&gt;每素材/每千次曝光&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; D3[&quot;按驱动因素&lt;br/&gt;模型token/人力工时/渠道配额&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; D4[&quot;按市场渠道&lt;br/&gt;定位成本异常&quot;]&#10;  D1 --&gt; AN[&quot;归因分析&quot;]&#10;  D2 --&gt; AN&#10;  D3 --&gt; AN&#10;  D4 --&gt; AN&#10;  AN --&gt; OPT[&quot;优化动作&quot;]&#10;  OPT --&gt; O1[&quot;模板改进降返工&quot;]&#10;  OPT --&gt; O2[&quot;抽样率调整降人力&quot;]&#10;  OPT --&gt; O3[&quot;缓存提升降重复生成&quot;]\">graph TD\n  C[\"创意总成本\"] --&gt; D1[\"按阶段&lt;br/&gt;生成/审校/适配/返工\"]\n  C --&gt; D2[\"按产出单位&lt;br/&gt;每素材/每千次曝光\"]\n  C --&gt; D3[\"按驱动因素&lt;br/&gt;模型token/人力工时/渠道配额\"]\n  C --&gt; D4[\"按市场渠道&lt;br/&gt;定位成本异常\"]\n  D1 --&gt; AN[\"归因分析\"]\n  D2 --&gt; AN\n  D3 --&gt; AN\n  D4 --&gt; AN\n  AN --&gt; OPT[\"优化动作\"]\n  OPT --&gt; O1[\"模板改进降返工\"]\n  OPT --&gt; O2[\"抽样率调整降人力\"]\n  OPT --&gt; O3[\"缓存提升降重复生成\"]</pre><p>四个维度缺一不可。只有总量无法回答&quot;该改哪里&quot;，只有阶段无法回答&quot;值不值得&quot;。实践中先把每笔成本记到最小的可归集单位（一次生成任务、一次审校动作、一次渠道适配），再由查询按需要的维度聚合。</p>\n<h3 id=\"成本记录的粒度\">成本记录的粒度</h3><p>成本记在<strong>动作</strong>上而不是<strong>人或部门</strong>上。这与 <a href=\"../aigc-creative-production/ai-copy-image-video-gen\">AI 文案/图/视频批量生成</a> 里 <code>generation_task.cost_micros</code> 的设计一致——每笔成本都要能追溯到一个具体动作，这样才可能按素材、按模板、按模型聚合。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE creative_cost_ledger (&#10;  entry_id     bigserial PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  occurred_at  timestamptz NOT NULL DEFAULT now(),&#10;  stage        text NOT NULL CHECK (stage IN&#10;                 (&#39;generate&#39;,&#39;localize&#39;,&#39;review&#39;,&#39;approve&#39;,&#39;adapt&#39;,&#39;rework&#39;,&#39;withdraw&#39;)),&#10;  driver       text NOT NULL CHECK (driver IN&#10;                 (&#39;model_tokens&#39;,&#39;model_images&#39;,&#39;model_video_seconds&#39;,&#10;                  &#39;human_minutes&#39;,&#39;channel_quota&#39;,&#39;storage_bytes&#39;)),&#10;  quantity     numeric(18,4) NOT NULL,&#10;  unit_cost_micros bigint NOT NULL,&#10;  total_micros bigint GENERATED ALWAYS AS&#10;                 ((quantity * unit_cost_micros)::bigint) STORED,&#10;  version_id   bigint,&#10;  task_id      bigint,&#10;  template_id  text,&#10;  model_id     text,&#10;  market       text,&#10;  channel      text,&#10;  actor_ref    text&#10;);&#10;CREATE INDEX cost_by_version  ON creative_cost_ledger (version_id, stage);&#10;CREATE INDEX cost_by_stage_day ON creative_cost_ledger (stage, occurred_at);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> creative_cost_ledger</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  entry_id     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bigserial</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  occurred_at  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">timestamptz</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  stage        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (stage </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                 (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'generate'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'localize'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'review'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'approve'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'adapt'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'rework'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'withdraw'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  driver       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (driver </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                 (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'model_tokens'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'model_images'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'model_video_seconds'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">                  'human_minutes'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'channel_quota'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'storage_bytes'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  quantity     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">numeric</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  unit_cost_micros </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bigint</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  total_micros </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bigint</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> GENERATED</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ALWAYS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                 ((quantity </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> unit_cost_micros)::</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bigint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) STORED,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  version_id   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bigint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  task_id      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bigint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  template_id  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  model_id     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  market       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  channel      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  actor_ref    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> cost_by_version</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> creative_cost_ledger (version_id, stage);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> cost_by_stage_day</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> creative_cost_ledger (stage, occurred_at);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>driver</code> 字段把&quot;消耗了什么资源&quot;与&quot;在哪个阶段&quot;分开，这是能做出正确优化动作的前提。审校阶段的成本驱动因素是 <code>human_minutes</code>，生成阶段是 <code>model_images</code> 或 <code>model_tokens</code>——两者的优化手段完全不同，混在一个 <code>cost</code> 列里就无法区分该优化模型选择还是该优化审校界面。</p>\n<h3 id=\"生成侧成本的模型选择含义\">生成侧成本的模型选择含义</h3><p>生成阶段的成本取决于用哪个模型、采样多少步、是否多次采样取优。以扩散模型为例，其训练目标是优化加权变分下界，生成时从纯噪声迭代去噪 <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2006.11239\">Denoising Diffusion Probabilistic Models</a>；潜空间扩散把去噪从像素空间搬到预训练自编码器的压缩潜空间，在保持细节的同时显著降低计算量，交叉注意力层让文本等条件无需重新训练即可注入 <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2112.10752\">High-Resolution Image Synthesis with Latent Diffusion Models</a>。需要定制风格时，低秩适配（LoRA）冻结预训练权重、只训练小的秩分解矩阵，可训练参数可下降约一万倍、显存下降约三倍，且低秩更新可在推理时合并、不增加延迟 <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2106.09685\">LoRA: Low-Rank Adaptation of Large Language Models</a>。</p>\n<p>这三条事实对应三种可控的成本杠杆，账本的 <code>model_id</code> 因此不只是一个名字：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模型侧选择</th>\n<th>成本影响</th>\n<th>质量影响</th>\n<th>何时采用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>像素空间 vs 潜空间</td>\n<td>推理成本显著降低</td>\n<td>细节保留良好</td>\n<td>默认走潜空间方案</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>采样步数与取优次数</td>\n<td>近似线性增长</td>\n<td>收益递减，通常 2–3 次后趋平</td>\n<td>关键位置取优，长尾不取优</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全量微调 vs LoRA 适配</td>\n<td>训练与存储成本大幅下降</td>\n<td>在多数风格定制上接近全量微调</td>\n<td>风格定制默认 LoRA</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"单位成本的换算\">单位成本的换算</h3><p>总成本本身没有决策价值，需要换算成可与业务量对齐的单位。三个基础单位：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>单位创意成本</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>∑</mo><msub><mtext>cost</mtext><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mtext>素材数</mtext></mfrac><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mtext>每千次曝光创意成本</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>∑</mo><mtext>cost</mtext></mrow><mtext>impressions</mtext></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>1000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{单位创意成本} = \\frac{\\sum \\text{cost}_{stage}}{\\text{素材数}} \\qquad \\text{每千次曝光创意成本} = \\frac{\\sum \\text{cost}}{\\text{impressions}} \\times 1000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">单位创意成本</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.113em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">素材数</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cost</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">每千次曝光创意成本</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3074em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">impressions</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cost</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1000</span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>有效创意成本</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>∑</mo><mtext>cost</mtext></mrow><mtext>通过审校且实际投放的素材数</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{有效创意成本} = \\frac{\\sum \\text{cost}}{\\text{通过审校且实际投放的素材数}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">有效创意成本</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.113em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">通过审校且实际投放的素材数</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cost</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>第三个是最有决策价值的。它把返工与废弃计算在内——如果一批生成里只有三成通过审校，单位成本就是表面成本的 3.3 倍。很多团队只统计第二个指标，于是得到一个非常漂亮但完全误导的数字。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>公式</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>陷阱</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单位创意成本</td>\n<td>总成本 / 生成素材数</td>\n<td>产能规划</td>\n<td>忽略废弃，虚低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>有效创意成本</td>\n<td>总成本 / 通过并投放的素材数</td>\n<td>真实效能对比</td>\n<td>需与审校数据对齐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>每千次曝光创意成本</td>\n<td>总成本 / 曝光量 × 1000</td>\n<td>与投放成本可比</td>\n<td>曝光受投放策略影响，创意不背全责</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>变体复用率</td>\n<td>复用呈现件数 / 总呈现件数</td>\n<td>参数化程度</td>\n<td>见 <a href=\"../creative-dam-model/market-channel-asset-reuse\">按市场×渠道的素材复用</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一次通过率</td>\n<td>首次审校通过数 / 提交审校数</td>\n<td>生成质量与模板成熟度</td>\n<td>抽样审校会让它失真</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最后一行是一个重要的方法论警告：<code>一次通过率</code> 只有在全量审校时才准确。如果抽样率随风险分层变化，通过率就只在层内可比，跨期比较会因为抽样结构变化而产生假趋势。正确做法是按层分别计算，或用抽样权重做还原。</p>\n<p>成本口径还需要说明&quot;审校&quot;这个阶段在做什么判断，否则分母无从定义。审校判断素材本身好不好（质量与品牌规范），审批判断素材能不能在特定市场投（法规与宣称证据），两者的失败后果与责任方都不同（见 <a href=\"../creative-approval-flow/creative-review-approval-workflow\">创意审批工作流与角色</a>）。账本里的 <code>review</code> 与 <code>approve</code> 必须分别记账，合并会让&quot;该优化审校效率还是该优化审批流程&quot;无法回答。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规模化的度量\">规模化的度量</h2><p>&quot;规模化&quot;不是&quot;数量大&quot;，而是&quot;数量增长时单位成本不增长&quot;。因此规模化的核心指标是成本曲线的形状，而不是绝对值。</p>\n<h3 id=\"单位成本随产量下降的检验\">单位成本随产量下降的检验</h3><p>如果系统真的在规模化，扩大产量时单位成本应当下降或至少持平。描述这条曲线的最简单模型是幂律：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>N</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c(N) = a \\cdot N^{-b}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c(N)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是产量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 时的单位成本，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 是规模弹性。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b &gt; 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 表示存在规模效应，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b \\approx 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 表示成本线性增长（没有规模效应）。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 的估计只需要两三个产量档位的数据点，用双对数坐标下的线性拟合即可。</p>\n<p>需要区分规模效应的来源：来自<strong>缓存命中率上升</strong>（同样的呈现件被复用）的部分是一次性的，会随市场份额饱和而消失；来自<strong>模板成熟度提升</strong>（返工率下降）的部分是可持续的。用两个指标拆开：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"SELECT date_trunc(&#39;week&#39;, occurred_at) AS wk,&#10;       SUM(total_micros) FILTER (WHERE stage = &#39;generate&#39;) AS gen_cost,&#10;       SUM(total_micros) FILTER (WHERE stage = &#39;review&#39;)   AS review_cost,&#10;       SUM(total_micros) FILTER (WHERE stage = &#39;rework&#39;)   AS rework_cost,&#10;       COUNT(DISTINCT version_id) FILTER (WHERE stage = &#39;generate&#39;) AS produced,&#10;       SUM(total_micros) / NULLIF(COUNT(DISTINCT version_id)&#10;         FILTER (WHERE stage = &#39;generate&#39;), 0) AS unit_cost&#10;  FROM creative_cost_ledger&#10; GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 1;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> date_trunc(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'week'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, occurred_at) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> wk,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(total_micros) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stage </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'generate'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gen_cost,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(total_micros) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stage </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'review'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> review_cost,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(total_micros) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stage </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'rework'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rework_cost,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DISTINCT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> version_id) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stage </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'generate'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> produced,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(total_micros) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> NULLIF</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DISTINCT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> version_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stage </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'generate'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> unit_cost</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> creative_cost_ledger</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>看 <code>rework_cost / gen_cost</code> 的比值随时间的变化：它下降说明模板在成熟；若持平而 <code>unit_cost</code> 也在下降，说明降本来自缓存或批量折扣，属于外部红利。</p>\n<h3 id=\"规模效应的两个来源\">规模效应的两个来源</h3><p>两个来源的机制与上限不同，混在一起看会把不可持续的红利当成能力提升：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  B[&quot;单位成本下降&quot;] --&gt; S1[&quot;来源一:缓存红利&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; S2[&quot;来源二:模板成熟&quot;]&#10;  S1 --&gt; S1a[&quot;呈现件复用率上升&quot;]&#10;  S1a --&gt; S1b[&quot;上限:市场内复用饱和&quot;]&#10;  S2 --&gt; S2a[&quot;返工率下降&quot;]&#10;  S2a --&gt; S2b[&quot;上限:返工趋近于零&quot;]&#10;  S1b --&gt; J{&quot;可持续性判定&quot;}&#10;  S2b --&gt; J&#10;  J --&gt;|缓存占比高| W[&quot;警告:红利将耗尽&quot;]&#10;  J --&gt;|模板占比高| G[&quot;健康:能力在提升&quot;]\">graph TD\n  B[\"单位成本下降\"] --&gt; S1[\"来源一:缓存红利\"]\n  B --&gt; S2[\"来源二:模板成熟\"]\n  S1 --&gt; S1a[\"呈现件复用率上升\"]\n  S1a --&gt; S1b[\"上限:市场内复用饱和\"]\n  S2 --&gt; S2a[\"返工率下降\"]\n  S2a --&gt; S2b[\"上限:返工趋近于零\"]\n  S1b --&gt; J{\"可持续性判定\"}\n  S2b --&gt; J\n  J --&gt;|缓存占比高| W[\"警告:红利将耗尽\"]\n  J --&gt;|模板占比高| G[\"健康:能力在提升\"]</pre><p>缓存命中率带来的降本有自然上限：同一批呈现件在市场内被复用到接近饱和后，继续扩大产量不会提高命中率，单位成本曲线会变平。判断是否接近上限，看&quot;呈现件被引用次数&quot;的分布——新增产出平均被引用次数下降，说明产量已在制造低复用价值的长尾，此时继续扩产是负收益的。</p>\n<p>模板成熟带来的降本没有这个上限，因为返工率可以持续下降，其信号是&quot;首次审校通过率&quot;上升且&quot;每素材的审校人时&quot;下降。两者同时改善才是真实的能力提升；只有一个改善则通常是抽样结构变了。</p>\n<h3 id=\"规模不经济的识别\">规模不经济的识别</h3><p>成本曲线向上弯折时，原因通常不是模型涨价，而是三件事之一：市场从主战场扩张到长尾市场时每个市场产量小、模板无法收敛；渠道数量增加但每个渠道产量不足、缓存命中率被摊薄；返工集中在少数难搞品类上拉高总体平均。这三种情况都需要在细分维度上分别看成本曲线，全局曲线会把它们平均掉。</p>\n<h3 id=\"规模化的三个前置条件\">规模化的三个前置条件</h3><p>成本曲线能否下降，取决于三个前置条件是否成立，任一个不成立都会让规模化的收益被抵消：</p>\n<p><strong>模板收敛。</strong> 模板数量增长快于产量增长时，每个模板的产出量少，模板本身的质量无法通过迭代提升，返工率居高不下。健康的模板数量应当随产量增长而<strong>次线性</strong>增长。</p>\n<p><strong>审校可自动化。</strong> 如果每一轮产量增长都带来审校人力线性增长，单位成本不可能下降。第 2 章的 <a href=\"../aigc-creative-production/human-review-brand-guard\">人工审校与品牌一致性</a> 里&quot;用缺陷数据补预检规则&quot;的机制就是为了让审校成本的增长慢于产量增长。</p>\n<p><strong>渠道适配可配置。</strong> 每新增一个渠道都要写代码时，扩张成本是阶跃式的。规格矩阵配置化（见 <a href=\"../creative-approval-flow/asset-publish-channel-distribute\">审批后多渠道分发</a>）是把这一步变成线性甚至常数的前提。</p>\n<p>用一组可观测的比值来监控这三个条件：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>条件</th>\n<th>监控比值</th>\n<th>期望方向</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>模板收敛</td>\n<td>活跃模板数 / 周产量</td>\n<td>下降或持平</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>审校可自动化</td>\n<td>审校人时 / 通过素材数</td>\n<td>下降</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适配可配置</td>\n<td>新增渠道的工程人日 / 渠道数</td>\n<td>下降</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生成质量</td>\n<td>返工成本 / 生成成本</td>\n<td>下降</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>缓存效率</td>\n<td>呈现件产出数 / 呈现件被引用数</td>\n<td>下降</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"与投放成本的正确比较\">与投放成本的正确比较</h2><p>创意成本是<strong>固定成本</strong>，投放成本是<strong>变动成本</strong>——素材做出来之后，多投一次不会增加创意成本。因此正确的比较不是&quot;创意成本占比多少&quot;，而是&quot;创意投入的边际回报是否为正&quot;。一个有用的判据是把创意成本折算到每次转化的口径，与投放成本相加：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>合并 CPA</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>投放 CPA</mtext><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mtext>该素材的创意成本</mtext><mtext>该素材的转化数</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{合并 CPA} = \\text{投放 CPA} + \\frac{\\text{该素材的创意成本}}{\\text{该素材的转化数}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">合并</span><span class=\"mord\"> CPA</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">投放</span><span class=\"mord\"> CPA</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">该素材的转化数</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">该素材的创意成本</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个式子暴露一个常见错误：用总创意成本除以总转化数会得到虚低的值，因为大部分素材的转化数是零或很少。正确做法是只在<strong>有转化的素材</strong>上做这个除法，并对零转化素材的成本单独统计——零转化素材的成本是纯粹的实验成本，应被看作探索支出而不是浪费，但必须显式计量，否则会被不知不觉地摊到成功素材上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"成本数据的治理\">成本数据的治理</h2><p>如果账本里只存 <code>total_micros</code> 而不存 <code>unit_cost_micros</code> 与 <code>quantity</code>，历史数据在定价变化后就无法区分&quot;数量变了&quot;还是&quot;单价变了&quot;。这就是账本表里必须同时存三者、并把 <code>total</code> 做成生成列的原因。</p>\n<h3 id=\"口径的版本化\">口径的版本化</h3><p>什么叫&quot;审校人时&quot;——是审校员的实际工作时长还是按素材数折算的标准工时？两者在优化决策上的含义不同。站点应当固定一个口径并记录其定义，口径变更时打标记：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;metricId&quot;: &quot;review_minutes_per_passed_asset&quot;,&#10;  &quot;definition&quot;: &quot;审校员实际工时（含等待与会话切换）/ 审校通过的素材数&quot;,&#10;  &quot;scope&quot;: &quot;per-stage-review&quot;,&#10;  &quot;effectiveFrom&quot;: &quot;2026-07-01&quot;,&#10;  &quot;supersedes&quot;: { &quot;effectiveTo&quot;: &quot;2026-06-30&quot;, &quot;definition&quot;: &quot;按素材数 × 标准工时折算 / 审校通过的素材数&quot; },&#10;  &quot;changeReason&quot;: &quot;折算口径掩盖了批量操作带来的效率提升&quot;,&#10;  &quot;expectedCurveBreak&quot;: true&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"metricId\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"review_minutes_per_passed_asset\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"definition\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"审校员实际工时（含等待与会话切换）/ 审校通过的素材数\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"scope\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"per-stage-review\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"effectiveFrom\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-07-01\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"supersedes\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"effectiveTo\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-06-30\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"definition\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"按素材数 × 标准工时折算 / 审校通过的素材数\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"changeReason\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"折算口径掩盖了批量操作带来的效率提升\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"expectedCurveBreak\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>expectedCurveBreak: true</code> 是给下游分析的提示：口径变更会在成本曲线上产生一个非业务原因的拐点。没有这个标记，分析者会把口径变化误读为效率变化，进而做出错误归因。</p>\n<h3 id=\"汇率与币种\">汇率与币种</h3><p>多市场成本汇总必须先统一币种。做法是在账本写入时就把 <code>unit_cost_micros</code> 换算成记账币种，同时保留原币种与汇率快照。使用写入时刻的汇率而不是查询时刻的汇率，是为了让历史数据可复现——否则同一份报告在不同时间运行会得到不同数字。汇率来源与取价时点（日终中间价或实时）必须固定并记录，这一点与 <a href=\"creative-performance-attribution\">素材效果与转化归因</a> 里效果数据的币种处理是同一要求。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>成本按阶段、产出单位、驱动因素、市场渠道四维归集，缺一维就无法定位优化点。</li>\n<li>成本记在动作上，<code>stage</code> 与 <code>driver</code> 分开，才能区分该优化模型还是该优化审校流程。</li>\n<li>有效创意成本（除以通过并投放的素材数）比单位创意成本更有决策价值，它包含废弃与返工。</li>\n<li>一次通过率在分层抽样下只在层内可比，跨期比较需按层计算或做抽样加权还原。</li>\n<li>规模化 = 产量增长时单位成本不增长，用幂律指数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 度量，并拆开缓存红利与模板成熟两类来源。</li>\n<li>三个前置条件：模板收敛、审校可自动化、渠道适配可配置，各有可监控比值。</li>\n<li>创意成本与投放成本是固定与变动的区别，合并 CPA 只在有转化的素材上计算，零转化素材的成本单独统计。</li>\n<li>账本必须同时存数量、单价、总额，否则定价变化后历史数据不可解释；成本口径需版本化。</li>\n<li>效果指标的定义见 <a href=\"creative-performance-attribution\">素材效果与转化归因</a>；复用决策如何消费成本数字见 <a href=\"winning-asset-reuse-signal\">高效素材识别与复用推荐</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"创意生产成本与规模化指标","id":"创意生产成本与规模化指标"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：成本的四个归集维度","id":"核心概念-成本的四个归集维度"},{"level":3,"text":"成本记录的粒度","id":"成本记录的粒度"},{"level":3,"text":"生成侧成本的模型选择含义","id":"生成侧成本的模型选择含义"},{"level":3,"text":"单位成本的换算","id":"单位成本的换算"},{"level":2,"text":"规模化的度量","id":"规模化的度量"},{"level":3,"text":"单位成本随产量下降的检验","id":"单位成本随产量下降的检验"},{"level":3,"text":"规模效应的两个来源","id":"规模效应的两个来源"},{"level":3,"text":"规模不经济的识别","id":"规模不经济的识别"},{"level":3,"text":"规模化的三个前置条件","id":"规模化的三个前置条件"},{"level":2,"text":"与投放成本的正确比较","id":"与投放成本的正确比较"},{"level":2,"text":"成本数据的治理","id":"成本数据的治理"},{"level":3,"text":"口径的版本化","id":"口径的版本化"},{"level":3,"text":"汇率与币种","id":"汇率与币种"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"高效素材识别与复用推荐","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/marketing-creative-dam-aigc-production/creative-performance-loop/winning-asset-reuse-signal"},"next":null}